          "editor": null
        },
        "contentStatus": "available",
        "content": {
          "format": "source-lines",
          "lines": [
            "1 Tat ro, he tanc baucna!",
            "Rey nungc mei nunc kumcna,",
            "Laanhmei ta athwngna,",
            "Baucna ding ngam kan e;",
            "Kangkai lev mai khou phaiclou e,",
            "’Ki Kazanc hym tiidaic kan e.",
            "",
            "2 Kaniw nac nunc aniu",
            "Kaniw phaykaamv suicna,",
            "Pingmei hei nai makna",
            "’Thanmei ric adow ni;",
            "Khrista tuang tanhmei rih mei nunc",
            "Dih ramgai khou bowlou lak ge.",
            "",
            "3 Tat ro, he tanc baucna",
            "Rih hei tancna bam khou!",
            "’Khuaimei lev siimei ta",
            "Baucna ’niu athwng kho;",
            "Rih tanc pwkhou ’niw ding ngam khang,",
            "Nang pumtan @<4 Pou, ’khavlou o.",
            "",
            "4 Rih hei ’dow saengc lak khe,",
            "’Thanmei ric ’dow ’thaekc ni!",
            "Lwmmei ric hei ngamna",
            "Chuzaenghna lungc ni the,",
            "Zauc lo, rih ngam pyrun how the,",
            "Tat tho, baucna he abumaengc."
          ]
        }
      },
